  "plan": "Capture exact stdout with cat -A to see exact bytes/whitespace. Examine image.ppm header and size. Determine which tools (python3, od, head, gcc) are available for deeper analysis.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "which python3 head od xxd gcc g++ 2>/dev/null\n",
